- Browse All signatures as small tiles with a preview of each signature's content.
- Edit the name separately from the text included in emails.
- Existing signature text, account defaults and draft edits are preserved. Older signatures receive editable names such as “Signature 1”.

The Add account redesign is still awaiting a design choice and is not part of this update.
